{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Tidal Arc 把潮汐預報化成流暢的曲線，讓你在桌面小工具、鎖定畫面和程式內一眼看清當下水位、正在漲潮還是退潮，以及下一次高潮與低潮的準確時間。無論是衝浪、海邊散步、掘蜆或劃獨木舟，只要行程隨著潮水走，都能派上用場。程式原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費，可於 App Store 下載。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460bb-75-197.webp\">\n<h2>潮汐曲線與即時小工具</h2>\n<p>主打小工具體驗：中型顯示今日潮汐曲線並標出即時位置，小型倒數下一次高潮或低潮，鎖定畫面可看潮汐與水位計。美國覆蓋逾 3,400 個 NOAA 官方潮汐站，全球其他地點由手機以衛星模型離線計算。程式可設定在高潮或低潮前通知，毋須帳戶、訂閱或廣告。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-337-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-338-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-339-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-340-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-341-scaled.jpg\">\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Tidal Arc: Tide Times High Low</li>\n<li>應用類別：Weather</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T22:58:57.052465+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":345,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T22:38:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T17:38:45.218882+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T22:57:43.037223+00:00","content_hash":"426c0b613d7ade3115868c8756255cea9af67886336da04cf75940d0a6e0ed72","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}